  m_text: 'Speed: 5          Agility: 5          Durability: 1          Stability:
    1

    Mercury is the closest, smallest, and fastest planet from the Sun. In
    fact, Mercury is about the size of our moon and orbits the Sun in just 88 days.
    Mercury also has the thinnest atmosphere of all the planets.

    Ability - Speedster:
    Mercury receives an explosive speed boost.

    Cooldown: 5s'
